            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "While Qena may not be as bustling with tourist activities as some other Egyptian cities, it still offers unique experiences that are worth exploring. Here’s a brief guide to things you can do in Qena:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
