            {
              "_key": "rtdoflfna0if",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and the Moulid Abd El-Rahim Al Qenawi festival provide enriching experiences for visitors. Additionally, its local markets and the possibility of nearby excursions make it a worthwhile stop on your journey through Egypt."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
